  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Fishing in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port Royal Marine Lab &amp; Biodiversity Centre at the University of the West Indies, Mona, an educational institution, is hereby awarded a grant to support &quot;Sustainable Fishing in the Caribbean.&quot; The Recipient shall: 1) Describe and promote sustainable fishing practices; 2) Increase awareness and reporting of IUU fishing; and 3) Enable fishers to maintain a valid fishing license.</narrative>
  </description>
